      "text": [
        {
          "id": "title",
          "visible": true,
          "kicker": "#5→0 · the source boundaries; the declared returns to C09, C37, C39, M05, M30, M36",
          "title": "Recognition returns to the aperture",
          "italic": "The whole returns-to its movements without substituting the image for derivations, warrants or tests: an essay section can carry the whole relational movement from its own angle — QL's native recursion supplying the capacity.",
          "body": "",
          "x": 0.04,
          "y": 0.05,
          "width": 560,
          "size": 30,
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "id": "body1",
          "visible": true,
          "kicker": "",
          "title": "",
          "italic": "",
          "body": "The viewer returns to the window with a changed understanding: what first appeared as a self-contained pattern now discloses the source, selected passages and boundaries of its appearing. A seam can be examined, a source reread, a translation qualified, a lens repositioned, an exclusion allowed to affect the next judgment. The Original remains prior throughout; within a declared Context Frame the achieved map can genuinely serve as local Bimba while remaining pratibimba relative to wider sources, and returned evidence can correct that local Bimba itself. The historical limits are kept: Dyczkowski's lattice-window",
          "x": 0.04,
          "y": 0.47,
          "width": 620,
          "size": 14,
          "align": "left",
          "w": 520
        },
        {
          "id": "body2",
          "visible": true,
          "kicker": "",
          "title": "",
          "italic": "",
          "body": "image gives a neighbouring account of light appearing diverse through limiting conditions; the mirror analogy expressly loses the external object ordinary reflection requires; an inert mirror can display without knowing — Vimarśa names the self-apprehending power; the sun outside this authored window supplies no warrant for a metaphysical source outside Consciousness. Bohm is Resonant with, not an extraction; Gebser used through page-specific paraphrase; no additional symbolism assigned to particular colours or panes. The complete construction returns-to C09, C37 and C39, and to M05, M30 and M36 as the declared movements.\n\nOccurrences: the examined seam and reread source (#2, #5→0); the local-Bimba office (#4, #5→0); the declared movement returns (#5→0).",
          "x": 0.6,
          "y": 0.47,
          "width": 505,
          "size": 14,
          "align": "left"
        }
      ],
